      c\u1EA7u l\xE0m vi\u1EC7c t\u1ED1t."
  - type: 2
    displayName: Vitamin C
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bfaa6a06070d3461a8c6b100e9fd503c, type: 3}
    effectText: "T\u1EBF b\xE0o g\xE2y th\xEAm 50% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng trong
      12 gi\xE2y. Rau xanh, tr\xE1i c\xE2y gi\xE0u vitamin C h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 h\u1EC7
      mi\u1EC5n d\u1ECBch."
  - type: 3
    displayName: "Gi\u1EA5c ng\u1EE7 ngon"
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 52e2384d4e2324faeb231edf7a0950ff, type: 3}
    effectText: "H\u1ED3i 2 m\xE1u tim v\xE0 h\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EA7y m\xE1u m\u1ECDi
